 assistant improves the time efficiency as well as reduces the efforts to perform simple repetitive tasks.","topics":[],"score":246004,"global_rank":69934},{"name":"kamal-hamza/Carpool","owner":"kamal-hamza","html_url":"https://github.com/kamal-hamza/Carpool","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Carpool Website with Django","topics":[],"score":246004,"global_rank":69935},{"name":"jaybo/temca_neural_qc","owner":"jaybo","html_url":"https://github.com/jaybo/temca_neural_qc","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Neural net to analyze TEMCA QC images","topics":[],"score":245999,"global_rank":69939},{"name":"saebyn/trapeze-wsgi","owner":"saebyn","html_url":"https://github.com/saebyn/trapeze-wsgi","stars":7,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A trapeze-compatible AMQP client that provides support for any web framework that uses the WSGI standard.","topics":[],"score":245995,"global_rank":69947},{"name":"privatekenny/rotation","owner":"privatekenny","html_url":"https://github.com/privatekenny/rotation","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":245995,"global_rank":69953},{"name":"rohit180497/Data-Encryption-Web-App","owner":"rohit180497","html_url":"https://github.com/rohit180497/Data-Encryption-Web-App","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":245986,"global_rank":69967},{"name":"adason/ktv","owner":"adason","html_url":"https://github.com/adason/ktv","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"KTV tool to split vocal and accompaniment from Youtube Video","topics":[],"score":245985,"global_rank":69971},{"name":"nikhilg-20/Organize_Meeting_Rooms","owner":"nikhilg-20","html_url":"https://github.com/nikhilg-20/Organize_Meeting_Rooms","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","descriptio